decision_conditions:
Condition : 8 - The externally illuminated projecting advertisement hereby approved shall comply with the following terms:
(a)	Between the hours of sunset and 23:00, the intensity of the illumination of the advertisement shall not exceed 200 candela per square metre;
(b)	Between the hours of 23:00 and sunrise, the intensity of the illumination of the advertisement shall not exceed 200 candela per square metre;
(c)	The advertisement shall be fitted with a light intensity monitoring censor to ensure the illuminance intensity is dimmable to take account of ambient light conditions and comply with the maximum recommended lighting intensity; 
(d)	The advertisement shall not display any moving, or apparently moving, images.  

Reason: In the interests of amenity and highway safety.
